# tasks/

This directory contains Mix task definitions for the Riffle project. Each task serves as a thin coordinator that delegates to the CLI framework, maintaining the Highlander principle by keeping the single entry point at the framework level rather than duplicating argument parsing or business logic.

## Files

- `riffle.cli.ex` -- Mix task doorway for `mix riffle.cli`; hands argv to Arca.Cli.main and returns
